  "instance_name": "muslim_refugee_stereotype",
  "label": "Stereotype of Muslim refugees as undesirable or threatening",
  "description": "The meme relies on the implicit stereotype that Muslim refugees are undesirable, dangerous, or incompatible with Western values. This stereotype is rooted in widespread Islamophobia, which often associates Muslims with terrorism, backwardness, or incompatibility with Western culture. The meme uses this stereotype to frame a false binary choice, suggesting that Muslim refugees are inferior to Swedish women, thereby promoting xenophobia and Islamophobia.",
